  "description": "Goldman is a Latin display typeface designed by Jaikishan Patel. It was exclusively designed for posters of Genre: Passion, Science Fiction, Sports, Drama, Thriller genres. The Goldman font family includes two weights. Regular, designed for the large headers or titles, and Bold, designed for heavyweight title designs. Each font includes 640 glyphs that covers Western, Central and South Latin as well as Vietnamese. To contribute, see https://github.com/magictype/goldman",
